## Project structure

```
dealmemory/
├── app/                      # Next.js App Router (public landing, console, API routes)
│   ├── api/                  # REST endpoints (events, keys, billing, webhooks, AI, predict)
│   ├── overview/             # Console overview dashboard
│   ├── journeys/             # Customer journey list & per-user timeline
│   ├── events/               # Raw event feed & inspector
│   ├── settings/             # Project keys, workspace config, billing portal
│   ├── docs/sdk              # SDK docs hub
│   ├── pricing/              # Tier selector (Starter Free / Growth Pro $49/mo)
│   ├── login / signup        # NextAuth credential authentication
│   └── page.tsx             # Public landing / homepage
├── components/               # UI component library
├── lib/                      # Core business logic, db client, keys, billing, privacy
├── packages/
│   ├── sdk/                  # TypeScript / JavaScript client library + CLI
│   └── python/               # Python client library
└── prisma/                   # Database schema & migrations
```

